<title>BELARUS: Belarus GDP rises two pct in Jan-Nov year-on-year.</title>
<headline>Belarus GDP rises two pct in Jan-Nov year-on-year.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belarus gross domestic product in the first 11 months of this year totalled 159.459 trillion Belarus roubles, which was two percent more than a year earlier in inflation-adjusted terms, the Statistics Ministry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>GDP in November was 6 percent higher than a year earlier.</p>
<p>    BELARUS GDP			  Nov 96    Oct 96    Nov 95</p>
<p>    month-on-month pct change	-18.0     -9.0	-14.0</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change	   +6.0     +4.0	-16.0</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
